   .. group-tab:: LED Strip

      Operate with the RGB digital LED strip :hwftlbl-led:`60 RGB`
      at :rpi-pico-spi:`SPI2_COPI` (|warn| :brd:`man. wired by user`):

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip get_length led_strip**
            ws2812\ @\ 0 has 60 pixel(s)

      Sett all LEDs to :brd:`RED`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 070000 60**

      Sett all LEDs to :byl:`YELLOW`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 070700 60**

      Sett all LEDs to :bgn:`GREEN`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 000700 60**

      Sett all LEDs to :bcy:`CYAN`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 000707 60**

      Sett all LEDs to :bbl:`BLUE`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 000007 60**

      Sett all LEDs to :bma:`MAGENTA`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 070007 60**

      Sett all LEDs to :bwt:`WHITE` (all on):

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 070707 60**

      Sett all LEDs to :bbk:`BLACK` (all off):

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 000000 60**
